---
import MovieFlexLegalLayout from "../layouts/MovieFlexLegalLayout.astro";
---

<MovieFlexLegalLayout
  title="Terms of use"
  description="Conditions for using MovieFlex's movie discovery and streaming availability interface."
  eyebrow="TERMS"
>
  <h2>Using MovieFlex</h2>
  <p>
    MovieFlex provides a movie-discovery interface for searching titles, viewing
    catalogue information, saving a local watchlist, and checking reported
    streaming, rental, or purchase options. Use the service lawfully and do not
    attempt to disrupt its operation.
  </p>
  <h2>Availability information</h2>
  <p>
    Provider listings, prices, subscription requirements, territories, and title
    availability can change. Information shown in MovieFlex is provided by
    third-party data sources and may be incomplete or delayed. Confirm details
    on the linked provider's own service before making a purchase or
    subscription decision.
  </p>
  <h2>No streaming service is provided</h2>
  <p>
    MovieFlex does not host, sell, license, or deliver films or television
    episodes. It does not guarantee access to a title and is not responsible for
    a streaming provider's catalogue, payment process, account, or service
    availability.
  </p>
  <h2>Third-party content</h2>
  <p>
    Movie names, descriptions, ratings, poster artwork, and provider
    availability may belong to or be licensed by their respective owners. TMDB
    and JustWatch remain independent third-party services. Their use is subject
    to their own terms.
  </p>
  <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Do not use MovieFlex to violate applicable law or another person's rights.
    </li>
    <li>
      Do not attempt to bypass access controls, overload the service, interfere
      with APIs, or extract data in a way that violates third-party terms.
    </li>
    <li>
      Do not assume that search results or provider listings are
      recommendations, guarantees, or endorsements.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Disclaimer</h2>
  <p>
    The project is provided on an “as available” basis without a guarantee that
    every feature will be uninterrupted, accurate, or available in every region.
    To the extent permitted by applicable law, the project owner disclaims
    warranties arising from use of this informational interface.
  </p>
  <h2>Changes and suspension</h2>
  <p>
    Features, data providers, or routes may change as the project is maintained.
    Access may be limited when necessary to protect the site, comply with law,
    or respond to upstream service changes.
  </p>
  <h2>Third-party terms and questions</h2>
  <p>
    Users must also follow the applicable terms of TMDB, JustWatch, and any
    streaming provider they visit. These general terms are a project template
    and are not a substitute for advice from a qualified lawyer. No
    governing-law clause or formal dispute contact has been configured for this
    portfolio project.
  </p>
</MovieFlexLegalLayout>
